<div id="AuditTrailDescription" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="24" data-tchmi-height="72" data-tchmi-right="24">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">The extension TcHmiAuditTrail records every change of the audited symbols with the old and the new value, the user and a comment. Change the values at the bottom and log in at the top right with another user to see more entries. Changes of MAIN.bTest need a comment.</p>
</div>
<div id="AuditTrailGrid" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.AuditTrailUtils.TcHmiAuditTrailGrid" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="112" data-tchmi-right="24" data-tchmi-bottom="24" data-tchmi-server-interval="1000" data-tchmi-show-menu-bar="true">
